    "Gamburuman: full Star evolution and W-Breaker, count every own Fire creature or Fire Tamaseed once, then destroy only opposing Blockers. Fire Tamaseed/creature dual type is counted once, a Fire field is excluded. Both evolution branches, mandatory Star replacement and W breaks are covered.",
    "Giga: optional destruction-only replacement by exactly 3 ordered own grave cards; insufficient payment, decline, bounce, ignored abilities and one physical payment reserved once during simultaneous destruction. First grave departure triggers all sources present at the departure, including a source subsequently destroyed in the same event. Native observation now occurs at the payment event to retain that source.",
