    "Earlier focused failures exposed the Tamaseed count flag and observation timing, both corrected and impact regressions passed. Fixture corrections exclude a true cost-9 twin and handle automatic mandatory Star replacement. npm run check, audit, target9500 and baseline invariants passed. nameKey count 9326. No push/publication/Netlify update."
